@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route115/scripts.inc: Route115_Text_NeverKnowWhenCavePokemonWillAppear
Hoenn_Route115_Text_NeverKnowWhenCavePokemonWillAppear::
	.string "Exploring a cave isn't like walking\n"
	.string "on a road.\p"
	.string "You never know when wild POKéMON will\n"
	.string "appear. It's full of suspense.$"

